MiniMatch contains original application and model-training code.

Amazon ESCI / Shopping Queries Dataset is downloaded separately from
https://github.com/amazon-science/esci-data at the commit pinned in the data
download script. The upstream LICENSE and NOTICE are preserved with local data.

The pretrained all-MiniLM-L6-v2 encoder is downloaded separately from
https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2 at the revision
pinned in the model configuration. Its original model card is preserved locally.

Datasets, pretrained and fine-tuned weights, generated indices, and dependency
binaries are not included in this source repository and keep their own terms.
